# Keystores are normally kept out of source control.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
#
# The Asaan release key and its passwords are the exception: the shop owner has
# no other copy, and losing the key means the app can never be updated on the
# Play Store again. They are committed on purpose (see RELEASE_KEYSTORE.md).
# Anything else that looks like a keystore still stays out of the repository.
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

!.gitignore
!key.properties
!app/asaan-release.jks

